{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29195","headline":"闻开江宋相公申锡下世二首 一 · 许浑","name":"闻开江宋相公申锡下世二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"权门阴奏夺移才，馹骑如星堕峡来。\n鼂氏有恩忠作祸，贾生无罪直爲灾。\n贞魂误向崇山殁，冤气疑从汩水回。\n毕竟功成何处是，五湖云月一帆开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}